 The following EMPIRE-code modules and features were used in      2634 1451  272
 the current evaluation:                                          2634 1451  273
 - Spherical and deformed Optical Model including                 2634 1451  274
   coupled-channels code ECIS06 by J. Raynal                      2634 1451  275
 - Soft-rotator deformed Optical Model including                  2634 1451  276
   coupled-channels code OPTMAN by E.Soukhovitskii                2634 1451  277
   and coworkers                                                  2634 1451  278
 - Hauser-Feshbach statistical model including                    2634 1451  279
   width fluctuation correction, and the                          2634 1451  280
   optical model for fission with partial damping                 2634 1451  281
 - Exciton model with Iwamoto-Harada cluster                      2634 1451  282
   emission and Kalbach systematic angular distr.                 2634 1451  283
   (code PCROSS by R.Capote et al)                                2634 1451  284
 - Complete gamma-ray cascade after emission of                   2634 1451  285
   each particle, including realistic treatment of                2634 1451  286
   discrete transitions                                           2634 1451  287
 - Access to OM segment of the RIPL library [10]                  2634 1451  288
 - Built-in input parameter files, such as masses,                2634 1451  289
   level density, discrete levels,                                2634 1451  290
   and gamma strength functions based on the RIPL                 2634 1451  291
   library [13]                                                   2634 1451  292
 - Automatic retrieval of experimental data from the              2634 1451  293
   EXFOR library                                                  2634 1451  294
 - ENDF-6 formatting (code EMPEND by A.Trkov)                     2634 1451  295
   coupled to graphical presentation capabilities                 2634 1451  296
   (code ZVView by V. Zerkin) through the chain of                2634 1451  297
   PrePro codes by D. Cullen                                      2634 1451  298
 - ENDF checking codes (CHECKR, FIZCON, PSYCHE)                   2634 1451  299
